    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93663" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελῑνούσιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>celery-leaved</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράμβη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eudem.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.369e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελινοῦσσα</span> is cj.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.21.2
			</span></i>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σ</span></b> . <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρός</span> is prob. wheat <i>of Selinus</i>
			in Sicily; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span></div>
